main-text-evaluated-type:0: set probeStoryRange to missing value
main-text-evaluated-type:1: set probeStoryRange to get story range boundDoc story type main text story
main-text-evaluated-type:2: set probeStoryRange to get probeStoryRange
main-text-evaluated-type:3: set probeValue to "unresolved-sentinel"
main-text-evaluated-type:4: set probeValue to get story type of probeStoryRange
main-text-evaluated-type:5: set probeValueClass to (class of probeValue) as text
main-text-evaluated-type:6: set probeRows to {{"scalar",probeValueClass,probeValue as text}}

["WPSCOMPOSER_WORD_SESSION_OK",[["read-ok",[["scalar","constant","main text story"]]]]]
